<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοσσ-εύω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοττ-</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and Hellenistic <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσσεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hatch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεόττευσεν γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					699
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>build a nest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				559a4
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιττῶν ἐν τῷ στήθει τοῦ λέοντος
					νενοσσευκότων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.8.6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[σοφία] θεμέλιον αἰῶνος ἐνόσσευσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα ἦν νενοσσευμένα ὀρνίθων
				γένεα</span> as many as <i>had their nests,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.159
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
